{
  "an3.91:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.91 ",
  "an3.91:0.2": "9. Samaṇavagga ",
  "an3.91:0.3": "Saṅkavāsutta ",
  "an3.91:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kosalesu cārikaṁ caramāno mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ yena saṅkavā nāma kosalānaṁ nigamo tadavasari. ",
  "an3.91:1.2": "Tatra sudaṁ bhagavā saṅkavāyaṁ viharati. ",
  "an3.91:1.3": "Tena kho pana samayena kassapagotto nāma bhikkhu saṅkavāyaṁ āvāsiko hoti. ",
  "an3.91:1.4": "Tatra sudaṁ bhagavā sikkhāpadapaṭisaṁyuttāya dhammiyā kathāya bhikkhū sandasseti samādapeti samuttejeti sampahaṁseti. ",
  "an3.91:1.5": "Atha kho kassapagottassa bhikkhuno bhagavati sikkhāpadapaṭisaṁyuttāya dhammiyā kathāya bhikkhū sandassente samādapente samuttejente sampahaṁsente ahudeva akkhanti ahu appaccayo: ",
  "an3.91:1.6": "“adhisallikhatevāyaṁ samaṇo”ti. ",
  "an3.91:1.7": "Atha kho bhagavā saṅkavāyaṁ yathābhirantaṁ viharitvā yena rājagahaṁ tena cārikaṁ pakkāmi. ",
  "an3.91:1.8": "Anupubbena cārikaṁ caramāno yena rājagahaṁ tadavasari. ",
  "an3.91:1.9": "Tatra sudaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati. ",
  "an3.91:2.1": "Atha kho kassapagottassa bhikkhuno acirapakkantassa bhagavato ahudeva kukkuccaṁ ahu vippaṭisāro: ",
  "an3.91:2.2": "“alābhā vata me, na vata me lābhā; dulladdhaṁ vata me, na vata me suladdhaṁ; ",
  "an3.91:2.3": "yassa me bhagavati sikkhāpadapaṭisaṁyuttāya dhammiyā kathāya bhikkhū sandassente samādapente samuttejente sampahaṁsente ahude